      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT to understand the code before improving it.Now I'll write the improved test with better understandability — meaningful constants for the opaque URL strings, descriptive variable names, and comments explaining each logical section.Now I'll compile-check the generated test.The improved test compiles successfully. The refactored version extracts the three opaque URL strings into named constants (`SVG_NAMESPACE_URI`, `XML_NAMESPACE_URI`, `MATHML_NAMESPACE_URI`), uses descriptive variable names, and adds comments that explain the logical sections and the intent behind each step — without changing any method calls, arguments, or assertions."
